==Trivia==
* The examine text is a reference to the vocal version of a song from [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Pan_(1953_film) Disney's Peter Pan], "Never Smile at a Crocodile".
* Despite being a crocodile, defeating one does not count for completion of the "In a while..." elite clue step.

